WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.174 --> 00:00:03.790
Do you often book beauty appointments on VaraaAi?

00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:06.911
Then put VaraaAi on your phone's home screen,

00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:09.390
so it opens as quickly as any other app.

00:00:09.651 --> 00:00:14.270
Installing takes one tap, it's completely free, and you don't need any app store.

00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:15.871
Why install it?

00:00:16.029 --> 00:00:20.351
Open the app, and your favourite salons are right there, so you book in seconds.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.591
You get appointment reminders on your phone.

00:00:22.702 --> 00:00:27.446
And the app updates together with the website, so it is always the latest version,

00:00:27.396 --> 00:00:28.591
and uses no storage.

00:00:29.227 --> 00:00:31.712
On an Android phone, or on a computer:

00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:38.032
open varaaai.com/app, in Chrome, Edge or Samsung Internet.

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:42.272
Tap Install the app, then choose Install when your browser asks.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.712
The VaraaAi icon appears on your home screen right away.

00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:47.948
On an iPhone or iPad:

00:00:48.037 --> 00:00:52.108
open varaaai.com/app, in Safari.

00:00:52.457 --> 00:00:55.437
Tap the Share button, the square with an arrow pointing up,

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:56.828
at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:57.096 --> 00:01:00.588
Scroll down, choose Add to Home Screen, and tap Add.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.124
One small tip:

00:01:02.383 --> 00:01:04.924
you don't need to remember the address of the install page.

00:01:05.193 --> 00:01:09.004
At the bottom of every VaraaAi page, you'll find three buttons:

00:01:09.113 --> 00:01:13.164
Install on Android, Install on iPhone, and Install on Desktop.

00:01:13.399 --> 00:01:17.084
Once it's installed, look for the VaraaAi icon on your home screen.

00:01:17.352 --> 00:01:19.964
From now on, booking is just a few taps away.

00:01:20.152 --> 00:01:21.804
Now take the quick quiz below!
